*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*       AT LINE-SELEKTION                                             *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*       Bei Zeilenselektion                                           *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT USER-COMMAND.

  FCODE = SY-UCOMM.
  CASE FCODE(4).                       "46A BEY

    WHEN 'BACK'.
      LEAVE.

    WHEN 'P+  '.
    WHEN 'P++ '.
    WHEN 'P-  '.
    WHEN 'P-- '.
    WHEN OTHERS.
      PERFORM FCODE_BEARBEITEN.
      LEAVE.

  ENDCASE.






*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*       TOP-OF-PAGE                                                   *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*       Bei Seitenanfang                                              *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*

TOP-OF-PAGE DURING LINE-SELECTION.

